          "_label": "descriptive note"
        }
      ],
      "content": "spikenard, an aromatic substance from a plant (Nardostachys Jatamansi) growing in India (Pegolotti 430; OED s.v. spikenard; MED s.v. spikenard n.); also called spica celtica, spica seltica (see also spyknard); used medicinally in herbal remedies; the meaning of arote (in spignarde arote) is unknown"
    }
